[CELL-DBG] ===========================================================================
[CELL-DBG] REMIX per-cell reactive-mixing (WMA) trace  one block per (step, target water)
[CELL-DBG] concentrations [mol/L]; reaction amounts [mol/L per step]; rates [mol/L/time]
[CELL-DBG] variables per block:
[CELL-DBG]   aq var act species : variable-activity aqueous species names (column order)
[CELL-DBG]   components         : u_i as a linear combination of var-act species (step 1)
[CELL-DBG]   mineral eq reactions: mineral order for min re_mean / min amnt_eq (step 1)
[CELL-DBG]   c_mix   : transported (mixed) concentrations entering the reaction step
[CELL-DBG]   c_tilde : purely conservative mix (transport only, no reaction)
[CELL-DBG]   c_hat   : reacted mix = c_mix + Dt*r_tilde (= c_mix if lumped/no kinetics)
[CELL-DBG]   c_new   : concentrations after the equilibrium/kinetic solve (end of step)
[CELL-DBG]   u_mix / u_hat / u_new : component totals U*c for c_mix / c_hat / c_new
[CELL-DBG]   surf compl / surf act : surface complex names and Gaines-Thomas activities
[CELL-DBG]   CEC check : sum(z*c) adsorbed equivalents vs stored exchange capacity (CEC)
[CELL-DBG]   contrib species : column order of the contrib_* rows (aq species, then surf)
[CELL-DBG]   contrib_eq  : equilibrium reaction contribution = c_new - c_hat - kin term
[CELL-DBG]   contrib_kin : kinetic reaction contribution to the species balance
[CELL-DBG]   min/exch amnt_eq : equilibrium reaction amounts Re (minerals, then exchange)
[CELL-DBG]   aq r_eq / min r_eq : equilibrium reaction rates = amnt_eq / Dt
[CELL-DBG]   aq/min rk_mean : step-averaged kinetic reaction rates
[CELL-DBG]   aq/min rk_new, rk_old : end-of-step and previous-step kinetic rates
